    "name": "Effects tour: type",
    "description": "Chapter 1 of the effects tour: every kinetic preset, exits, glyph units, gradient / texture / shimmer fills, echo trails, balanced wrapping and colour emoji in type.",
    "creativeDirection": "One preset per beat, each named in a small mono label so the viewer learns the vocabulary while it moves. Ink and plum grounds, white Bebas, pink / yellow / lavender accents only. Review: every block lands before the cut and holds long enough to read, the label never collides with the headline, and fills read as the letters themselves."
